description: "Manufacturer master record used to manage automotive brands, ownership context, and related manufacturing plants."
documentation: "Manufacturer master record used to manage automotive brands, ownership context, and related manufacturing plants. Use this entity to understand and govern this business object in the Manufacturing and Automotive accelerator applications."
historizeGolden: true
historizeMaster: true
physicalTableName: MANUFACTURER
dataEntryAllowed: true
attributes:
